{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BODYCOMBAT 100 IS HERE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A DLC for all Les Mills fans: Enjoy this epic milestone in BODYCOMBAT history of it being in clubs for 25 years and releasing its 100th program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa <strong>8 new workouts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring one exclusive session adapted from the real-life BODYCOMBAT 100 program! Enjoy your training sessiones with 25 new songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaf <strong>New game mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 is not just a number. It\u2019s a milestone. A movement. A mentality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your all with 100 Hustle. Be focused with the 100 Hit Challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude99 <strong>New environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the first closed environment of LES MILLS XR BODYCOMBAT, a place where some pieces of Bodycombat history are kept. A proud tribute to BODYCOMBAT. A virtual Hall of Fame where we appreciate the 25 years of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4a<strong>Premium cosmetics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip the exclusive, brand new BODYCOMBAT 100 gloves. A new platform is available too!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535940?t=1758872594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535940/7070898b69c6ea693393dc14d8977d578965bec3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758872594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535940/b1442d7a4955cf08bdfef3ce58997b61268b8a9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758872594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535940/b1442d7a4955cf08bdfef3c